13b3971daea", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e43b5dc/uploads/origins/0ec04f8e-b1a7-4a4c-8de6-20a39df1f868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ea7eada0c0d281684ce7b13b3971daea, https://si.imgix.net/4e43b5dc/uploads/origins/0ec04f8e-b1a7-4a4c-8de6-20a39df1f868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=013e2484d22fd35e95af5ab3bf541938 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e43b5dc/uploads/origins/0ec04f8e-b1a7-4a4c-8de6-20a39df1f868?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=703d829b303e3b9c1929349c545eb96f 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! My name is Mikecha.\n\nI saw your X (old Twitter) page and thought I would like to contact you to request your help.\n\nI would like to ask you to write my V (please refer to the URL of the document)!\nThere are no restrictions on clothing, hairstyle, facial expression, composition, etc.\nPlease write it as you like, Mochi-sama. ☺️\n\nThe use of this image will be for icons, thumbnails of videos, and ohaV, etc.\nWe would appreciate it if you could make it so that the characters are not cut off as much as possible. We would also appreciate transparency of only the characters.\n\nIf possible, we would be happy to receive facial expression differences as well. ☺️\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://x.com/nekooto_mike___?s=21&t=cBL4Qj_TDK0qF8g4cfXXuA", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@motimommm/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2596252, "client_id": 460270, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10d8d639447cf40239e2de31850f8133", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10d8d639447cf40239e2de31850f8133, https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70ffd6c7b34a7dd4d414f756f261e6f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c715a31c7bbe0d4f0b020afd4d48bb91 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=207e4808a174aeda5d314111520c01b8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=207e4808a174aeda5d314111520c01b8, https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dcb40e5a66704abf4d9f59f852cee8ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5e5669ce/uploads/origins/e20a5449-4b99-4fe2-bd0d-c3d47c55acce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a98406adc74001dee30f9a9cad43824d 3x"}, "body": "I was attracted by the beautiful and cute design of the picture, so I sent a request.\nIt is a little bit special, so if you are interested, I would appreciate it very much.\nI would like you to draw a character in a balloon for the Mario Party 4 mini-game \"Pyon Pyon Balloon.\n\nReference video\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NWQnT5-To7o&pp=ygUe44G044KH44KT44G044KH44KT44OQ44Or44O844Oz\nReference illustration\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/102099398\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/106518620\n\nI would like to have a picture of the four girls of your choice.\nThe girls you have designed are very cute, so I would like you to draw 4 original girls of your choice.\nI would be happy if you could draw a few more girls of your choice if you like.\nThey should all be the same size.\nThe base of the drawing should be from a top angle like the illustration below, with the face facing the front of the camera.\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/98696560\nThe faces should basically be facing frontal.\nThe face should be facing forward and the expression should be normal, almost like a smile.\nThe hair should be a little more voluminous to make it look prettier.\nThe hair on the back can be omitted when combined with the balloon, but we would like to enjoy the front face only as shown in the illustration below, so please draw the hair on the back as well with the difference.\nPlease send me the following illustration: https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/109302407\nI would like to see the head, back hair, hair and other parts, hat and accessories.\nI would also like to see a wink or a shy expression on her face.\nFor reference, the size ratio of the head to the balloons is about 1:3.\nThe balloons should have a circus-like pattern in each character's image color, just like in the original work.\nThe balloons should be the same for all the characters and only the color should be changed.\nWe would appreciate it if you could keep the layers as separate as possible so that we can change the colors.\n\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@ak36epk/works/3", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@motimommm/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2596252, "client_id": 923885, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/091da42c/uploads/origins/46409d57-b099-49b8-8c21-efcc77108c6a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&